    "v_c11293bda31d14a7_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 420.096009,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国最适合慢慢走的原生态古镇是哪一座吗？上集，咱们聊了木渎新氏青木川，钱同偏言这集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名让人心安到什么程度。尤其是排在榜首的那座藏在隐秘山谷里，留存着整个茶马古道上唯一存活至今的原生态集市。日子安宁的像停在了几百年前。看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，收藏起来，省得手一滑，咱们就错过了。第五名，锦溪古镇，江苏苏州，昆山下集头一站，咱们回到您最熟的江南，锦西守着五宝湖，镇上有三十六座古桥，有的跨河，有的就架在湖面上。一座挨着，一座锦面变开阔，站在桥上，眼前没有遮挡视野，一下子就打开了古莲。池边风一吹，荷叶晃成一片盐湖，那条青石板路，平平缓缓，不用爬坡。三十六座桥。您想想，一天只走一座也够，您走一个多月，您不用赶着打卡，走几步就能停下来看水，看够了，再往前走，一步停一会儿，心里一点不亏欠，谁这才叫慢慢走。第四名名鹤古镇，浙江宁波慈溪听名字像仙鹤待的地方。老辈人说，唐朝有位隐士，在这住过镇子，就叫了名贺。他一边临着白杨湖，一边是青蛙老街，湖边的堤是平缓的步道。镇上最出名的是国药叶种德唐开了三百多年，药柜一排挨一排，到今天还摆在那儿。您一进老街，先闻到的是药草味，淡淡的苦里带点甘，顺着街走到湖边，风里就换成了水汽。这儿不用您打起精神，是让您把气喘匀的地方。一边是湖，一边是药铺，走着走着肩膀就松下来了。第三名，姚里古镇，江西景德镇浮梁。很多人知道景德镇的瓷器，却不知道窑里才是瓷器的源头。一条清冽见底的瑶河从大山深处流出，把镇子一分为二，两岸整整齐齐排开。上百幢明清徽派老屋飞檐翘角，被苍翠的山林抱在怀里。清晨，山里的晨雾漫过河面，河滩上是一声接一声的木锤倒衣声木桥，横跨两岸老樟树，垂下浓荫，这就是真正的天青色等烟雨。没有商业的矫揉造作，您撑一把伞，踩在湿润的石阶上，走在水墨画一般的景致里，身心都被这片山水洗的清透窑里排第三，靠的是两个字，出尘。第二名，黄姚古镇，广西贺州昭平。一提广西，您先想到桂林的山，黄窑的山也不疏，齐峰一座座从田里拔起来，溪水绕着镇子回环。他宋朝开宝年间就有了一千多年下来，明清时越来越热闹。抗战那几年，不少文化人躲到这避难。待龙桥边有龙爪龙根须垂下来，向龙爪抓着地，把青石路折的严严实实。站在桥上，一抬头是清风，古树，一低头是溪水。这儿天气温润，街巷里的人家就在山水中间过日子，中间没有一道围墙。黄瑶排第二，靠的是两个字，天然第一名。沙溪古镇，云南、大理建川。为什么是他？很多朋友以为，榜首肯定是大理古城或者凤凰古镇，可那些地方早就被酒吧、民谣和游客填满了。而沙溪一直安静的藏在剑川县黑会江畔的狭长盆地里。当年两千多公里的茶马古道马蹄声碎，几百年过去，所有的古籍是全被现代公路和高楼大厦抹平了，唯独留下杀溪。这一个完整活着的古籍是红砂石铺成的四方街上。古戏台信教寺隔街相望，四周是土坯墙和黑瓦屋顶，地势平展如镜，黑惠江水安安静静躺过玉金桥几百岁的老槐树，叶子落了一地。这里没有检票口，没有拉客的导游，当地白族阿婆挽着竹篮，慢慢走过小巷，连猫狗都躺在石板上午睡。他没有把岁月当成商品卖掉，而是完整封存了时间最原始的模样。在沙溪走路，您根本不用考虑往哪儿拐，也不用赶任何景点，每一步都踩在平缓的大地上，听得见江水，声闻得见泥土香。杀溪排第一，靠的是两个字，本真十座。古镇讲完了，目睹让您听得平淡，放下赶路的劲儿。新氏是何布头洗菜的老街坊、青木川、青藻的河面起着三省交界的雾。钱童家家门前躺着泉水偏严的黄爵树底下排着一溜竹蚁锦溪三十六座桥，一天走一座够走一个多月，鸣贺在药草香里调神窑里，在天情水墨里出沉。可只有沙溪古镇两千公里，茶马古道退去繁华，他却守住了天地间最干净的从容。您说什么叫最适合？慢慢走慢慢走，不是脚下慢，是心里没有下一站在催您最后问问您这十处古镇，您去过几处最想去的是哪一处？评论区告诉我，觉得这期让您长了见识，就转给身边跟您一样，爱看古镇风物的人，想听更多大美。中国山河的故事点个关注，咱们下期接着了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 4610,
      "text": "您知道中国最适合慢慢走的原生态古镇是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5210,
      "end_ms": 5870,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5890,
      "end_ms": 10330,
      "text": "咱们聊了木渎新氏青木川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10410,
      "end_ms": 14550,
      "text": "钱同偏言这集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14970,
      "end_ms": 18110,
      "text": "看看前五名让人心安到什么程度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18110,
      "end_ms": 23270,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座藏在隐秘山谷里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00007",
      "start_ms": 23270,
      "end_ms": 29635,
      "text": "留存着整个茶马古道上唯一存活至今的原生态集市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00008",
      "start_ms": 30140,
      "end_ms": 33360,
      "text": "日子安宁的像停在了几百年前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00009",
      "start_ms": 33800,
      "end_ms": 35880,
      "text": "看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00010",
      "start_ms": 36040,
      "end_ms": 37600,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00011",
      "start_ms": 37780,
      "end_ms": 38560,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00012",
      "start_ms": 38740,
      "end_ms": 39640,
      "text": "省得手一滑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00013",
      "start_ms": 39720,
      "end_ms": 40660,
      "text": "咱们就错过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00014",
      "start_ms": 40940,
      "end_ms": 41680,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42060,
      "end_ms": 43300,
      "text": "锦溪古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43640,
      "end_ms": 44680,
      "text": "江苏苏州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44700,
      "end_ms": 47200,
      "text": "昆山下集头一站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47440,
      "end_ms": 49600,
      "text": "咱们回到您最熟的江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00019",
      "start_ms": 50040,
      "end_ms": 51580,
      "text": "锦西守着五宝湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52020,
      "end_ms": 53860,
      "text": "镇上有三十六座古桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00021",
      "start_ms": 54460,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "有的跨河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00022",
      "start_ms": 55820,
      "end_ms": 57460,
      "text": "有的就架在湖面上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00023",
      "start_ms": 57700,
      "end_ms": 58600,
      "text": "一座挨着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58600,
      "end_ms": 60705,
      "text": "一座锦面变开阔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00025",
      "start_ms": 61090,
      "end_ms": 62030,
      "text": "站在桥上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00026",
      "start_ms": 62170,
      "end_ms": 64010,
      "text": "眼前没有遮挡视野，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00027",
      "start_ms": 64010,
      "end_ms": 66130,
      "text": "一下子就打开了古莲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00028",
      "start_ms": 66130,
      "end_ms": 67445,
      "text": "池边风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00029",
      "start_ms": 67860,
      "end_ms": 70440,
      "text": "荷叶晃成一片盐湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00030",
      "start_ms": 70460,
      "end_ms": 71860,
      "text": "那条青石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00031",
      "start_ms": 72020,
      "end_ms": 73160,
      "text": "平平缓缓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00032",
      "start_ms": 73280,
      "end_ms": 74275,
      "text": "不用爬坡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00033",
      "start_ms": 74800,
      "end_ms": 76225,
      "text": "三十六座桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00034",
      "start_ms": 76570,
      "end_ms": 77145,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00035",
      "start_ms": 77430,
      "end_ms": 79450,
      "text": "一天只走一座也够，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00036",
      "start_ms": 79450,
      "end_ms": 80655,
      "text": "您走一个多月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00037",
      "start_ms": 81040,
      "end_ms": 82315,
      "text": "您不用赶着打卡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00038",
      "start_ms": 83060,
      "end_ms": 85465,
      "text": "走几步就能停下来看水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00039",
      "start_ms": 86030,
      "end_ms": 86750,
      "text": "看够了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00040",
      "start_ms": 86750,
      "end_ms": 88640,
      "text": "再往前走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00041",
      "start_ms": 88680,
      "end_ms": 90145,
      "text": "一步停一会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00042",
      "start_ms": 90510,
      "end_ms": 91730,
      "text": "心里一点不亏欠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00043",
      "start_ms": 91730,
      "end_ms": 93575,
      "text": "谁这才叫慢慢走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00044",
      "start_ms": 93930,
      "end_ms": 96095,
      "text": "第四名名鹤古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00045",
      "start_ms": 96540,
      "end_ms": 100715,
      "text": "浙江宁波慈溪听名字像仙鹤待的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00046",
      "start_ms": 101140,
      "end_ms": 101920,
      "text": "老辈人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00047",
      "start_ms": 101980,
      "end_ms": 103380,
      "text": "唐朝有位隐士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00048",
      "start_ms": 103460,
      "end_ms": 105000,
      "text": "在这住过镇子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00049",
      "start_ms": 105000,
      "end_ms": 106155,
      "text": "就叫了名贺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00050",
      "start_ms": 106640,
      "end_ms": 108335,
      "text": "他一边临着白杨湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00051",
      "start_ms": 108670,
      "end_ms": 110075,
      "text": "一边是青蛙老街，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00052",
      "start_ms": 110540,
      "end_ms": 112985,
      "text": "湖边的堤是平缓的步道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00053",
      "start_ms": 113470,
      "end_ms": 118295,
      "text": "镇上最出名的是国药叶种德唐开了三百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00054",
      "start_ms": 118760,
      "end_ms": 120660,
      "text": "药柜一排挨一排，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00055",
      "start_ms": 121020,
      "end_ms": 122695,
      "text": "到今天还摆在那儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00056",
      "start_ms": 123070,
      "end_ms": 124370,
      "text": "您一进老街，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00057",
      "start_ms": 124850,
      "end_ms": 127055,
      "text": "先闻到的是药草味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00058",
      "start_ms": 127490,
      "end_ms": 129785,
      "text": "淡淡的苦里带点甘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00059",
      "start_ms": 130520,
      "end_ms": 132405,
      "text": "顺着街走到湖边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00060",
      "start_ms": 132760,
      "end_ms": 134635,
      "text": "风里就换成了水汽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00061",
      "start_ms": 135000,
      "end_ms": 136775,
      "text": "这儿不用您打起精神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00062",
      "start_ms": 137330,
      "end_ms": 139775,
      "text": "是让您把气喘匀的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00063",
      "start_ms": 140390,
      "end_ms": 141465,
      "text": "一边是湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00064",
      "start_ms": 141900,
      "end_ms": 142925,
      "text": "一边是药铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00065",
      "start_ms": 143370,
      "end_ms": 146205,
      "text": "走着走着肩膀就松下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00066",
      "start_ms": 146620,
      "end_ms": 147385,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00067",
      "start_ms": 147730,
      "end_ms": 148555,
      "text": "姚里古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00068",
      "start_ms": 149120,
      "end_ms": 151075,
      "text": "江西景德镇浮梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00069",
      "start_ms": 151840,
      "end_ms": 154045,
      "text": "很多人知道景德镇的瓷器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00070",
      "start_ms": 154430,
      "end_ms": 157375,
      "text": "却不知道窑里才是瓷器的源头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00071",
      "start_ms": 158140,
      "end_ms": 161925,
      "text": "一条清冽见底的瑶河从大山深处流出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00072",
      "start_ms": 162430,
      "end_ms": 163975,
      "text": "把镇子一分为二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00073",
      "start_ms": 164410,
      "end_ms": 166070,
      "text": "两岸整整齐齐排开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00074",
      "start_ms": 166070,
      "end_ms": 169700,
      "text": "上百幢明清徽派老屋飞檐翘角，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00075",
      "start_ms": 169960,
      "end_ms": 172035,
      "text": "被苍翠的山林抱在怀里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00076",
      "start_ms": 172630,
      "end_ms": 173110,
      "text": "清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00077",
      "start_ms": 173210,
      "end_ms": 175205,
      "text": "山里的晨雾漫过河面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00078",
      "start_ms": 175730,
      "end_ms": 180480,
      "text": "河滩上是一声接一声的木锤倒衣声木桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00079",
      "start_ms": 180580,
      "end_ms": 183160,
      "text": "横跨两岸老樟树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00080",
      "start_ms": 183360,
      "end_ms": 184240,
      "text": "垂下浓荫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00081",
      "start_ms": 184980,
      "end_ms": 188020,
      "text": "这就是真正的天青色等烟雨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00082",
      "start_ms": 188700,
      "end_ms": 191060,
      "text": "没有商业的矫揉造作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00083",
      "start_ms": 191440,
      "end_ms": 192560,
      "text": "您撑一把伞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00084",
      "start_ms": 192680,
      "end_ms": 194420,
      "text": "踩在湿润的石阶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00085",
      "start_ms": 194880,
      "end_ms": 197280,
      "text": "走在水墨画一般的景致里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00086",
      "start_ms": 197640,
      "end_ms": 202300,
      "text": "身心都被这片山水洗的清透窑里排第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00087",
      "start_ms": 202720,
      "end_ms": 203860,
      "text": "靠的是两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00088",
      "start_ms": 204120,
      "end_ms": 204700,
      "text": "出尘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00089",
      "start_ms": 205120,
      "end_ms": 205720,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00090",
      "start_ms": 206140,
      "end_ms": 207160,
      "text": "黄姚古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00091",
      "start_ms": 207560,
      "end_ms": 209285,
      "text": "广西贺州昭平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00092",
      "start_ms": 210020,
      "end_ms": 211160,
      "text": "一提广西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00093",
      "start_ms": 211580,
      "end_ms": 213540,
      "text": "您先想到桂林的山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00094",
      "start_ms": 214160,
      "end_ms": 215640,
      "text": "黄窑的山也不疏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00095",
      "start_ms": 216540,
      "end_ms": 219180,
      "text": "齐峰一座座从田里拔起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00096",
      "start_ms": 219680,
      "end_ms": 221700,
      "text": "溪水绕着镇子回环。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00097",
      "start_ms": 222160,
      "end_ms": 226660,
      "text": "他宋朝开宝年间就有了一千多年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00098",
      "start_ms": 227080,
      "end_ms": 229000,
      "text": "明清时越来越热闹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00099",
      "start_ms": 229560,
      "end_ms": 230620,
      "text": "抗战那几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00100",
      "start_ms": 230980,
      "end_ms": 233040,
      "text": "不少文化人躲到这避难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00101",
      "start_ms": 233420,
      "end_ms": 236900,
      "text": "待龙桥边有龙爪龙根须垂下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00102",
      "start_ms": 236900,
      "end_ms": 238140,
      "text": "向龙爪抓着地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00103",
      "start_ms": 238500,
      "end_ms": 240635,
      "text": "把青石路折的严严实实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00104",
      "start_ms": 241030,
      "end_ms": 241870,
      "text": "站在桥上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00105",
      "start_ms": 242130,
      "end_ms": 243750,
      "text": "一抬头是清风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00106",
      "start_ms": 243810,
      "end_ms": 244255,
      "text": "古树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00107",
      "start_ms": 244630,
      "end_ms": 246255,
      "text": "一低头是溪水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00108",
      "start_ms": 246570,
      "end_ms": 248045,
      "text": "这儿天气温润，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00109",
      "start_ms": 248810,
      "end_ms": 252195,
      "text": "街巷里的人家就在山水中间过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00110",
      "start_ms": 252780,
      "end_ms": 254445,
      "text": "中间没有一道围墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00111",
      "start_ms": 255150,
      "end_ms": 256365,
      "text": "黄瑶排第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00112",
      "start_ms": 256690,
      "end_ms": 257845,
      "text": "靠的是两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00113",
      "start_ms": 258230,
      "end_ms": 259720,
      "text": "天然第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00114",
      "start_ms": 260040,
      "end_ms": 260995,
      "text": "沙溪古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00115",
      "start_ms": 261450,
      "end_ms": 262915,
      "text": "云南、大理建川。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00116",
      "start_ms": 263490,
      "end_ms": 264475,
      "text": "为什么是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00117",
      "start_ms": 264920,
      "end_ms": 265860,
      "text": "很多朋友以为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00118",
      "start_ms": 265860,
      "end_ms": 269445,
      "text": "榜首肯定是大理古城或者凤凰古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00119",
      "start_ms": 270130,
      "end_ms": 274195,
      "text": "可那些地方早就被酒吧、民谣和游客填满了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00120",
      "start_ms": 274630,
      "end_ms": 282115,
      "text": "而沙溪一直安静的藏在剑川县黑会江畔的狭长盆地里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00121",
      "start_ms": 282550,
      "end_ms": 286565,
      "text": "当年两千多公里的茶马古道马蹄声碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00122",
      "start_ms": 287020,
      "end_ms": 288235,
      "text": "几百年过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00123",
      "start_ms": 288640,
      "end_ms": 293765,
      "text": "所有的古籍是全被现代公路和高楼大厦抹平了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00124",
      "start_ms": 294350,
      "end_ms": 295950,
      "text": "唯独留下杀溪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00125",
      "start_ms": 296190,
      "end_ms": 301825,
      "text": "这一个完整活着的古籍是红砂石铺成的四方街上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00126",
      "start_ms": 302530,
      "end_ms": 305555,
      "text": "古戏台信教寺隔街相望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00127",
      "start_ms": 306260,
      "end_ms": 308745,
      "text": "四周是土坯墙和黑瓦屋顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00128",
      "start_ms": 309230,
      "end_ms": 310735,
      "text": "地势平展如镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00129",
      "start_ms": 311150,
      "end_ms": 315950,
      "text": "黑惠江水安安静静躺过玉金桥几百岁的老槐树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00130",
      "start_ms": 315950,
      "end_ms": 317345,
      "text": "叶子落了一地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00131",
      "start_ms": 317760,
      "end_ms": 319125,
      "text": "这里没有检票口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00132",
      "start_ms": 319620,
      "end_ms": 321095,
      "text": "没有拉客的导游，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00133",
      "start_ms": 321680,
      "end_ms": 323980,
      "text": "当地白族阿婆挽着竹篮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00134",
      "start_ms": 323980,
      "end_ms": 325215,
      "text": "慢慢走过小巷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00135",
      "start_ms": 325730,
      "end_ms": 328195,
      "text": "连猫狗都躺在石板上午睡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00136",
      "start_ms": 328630,
      "end_ms": 330885,
      "text": "他没有把岁月当成商品卖掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00137",
      "start_ms": 331300,
      "end_ms": 335205,
      "text": "而是完整封存了时间最原始的模样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00138",
      "start_ms": 335650,
      "end_ms": 336655,
      "text": "在沙溪走路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00139",
      "start_ms": 337030,
      "end_ms": 338745,
      "text": "您根本不用考虑往哪儿拐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00140",
      "start_ms": 339100,
      "end_ms": 340745,
      "text": "也不用赶任何景点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00141",
      "start_ms": 341210,
      "end_ms": 344085,
      "text": "每一步都踩在平缓的大地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00142",
      "start_ms": 344660,
      "end_ms": 345760,
      "text": "听得见江水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00143",
      "start_ms": 345760,
      "end_ms": 347665,
      "text": "声闻得见泥土香。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00144",
      "start_ms": 348320,
      "end_ms": 349320,
      "text": "杀溪排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00145",
      "start_ms": 349620,
      "end_ms": 350955,
      "text": "靠的是两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00146",
      "start_ms": 351590,
      "end_ms": 352850,
      "text": "本真十座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00147",
      "start_ms": 352850,
      "end_ms": 353775,
      "text": "古镇讲完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00148",
      "start_ms": 354400,
      "end_ms": 355940,
      "text": "目睹让您听得平淡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00149",
      "start_ms": 356060,
      "end_ms": 357395,
      "text": "放下赶路的劲儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00150",
      "start_ms": 358050,
      "end_ms": 365315,
      "text": "新氏是何布头洗菜的老街坊、青木川、青藻的河面起着三省交界的雾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00151",
      "start_ms": 365910,
      "end_ms": 373910,
      "text": "钱童家家门前躺着泉水偏严的黄爵树底下排着一溜竹蚁锦溪三十六座桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00152",
      "start_ms": 373970,
      "end_ms": 376205,
      "text": "一天走一座够走一个多月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00153",
      "start_ms": 376670,
      "end_ms": 380300,
      "text": "鸣贺在药草香里调神窑里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00154",
      "start_ms": 380340,
      "end_ms": 382775,
      "text": "在天情水墨里出沉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00155",
      "start_ms": 383280,
      "end_ms": 386400,
      "text": "可只有沙溪古镇两千公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00156",
      "start_ms": 386500,
      "end_ms": 388725,
      "text": "茶马古道退去繁华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00157",
      "start_ms": 389280,
      "end_ms": 392565,
      "text": "他却守住了天地间最干净的从容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00158",
      "start_ms": 393320,
      "end_ms": 394820,
      "text": "您说什么叫最适合？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00159",
      "start_ms": 394820,
      "end_ms": 396480,
      "text": "慢慢走慢慢走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00160",
      "start_ms": 396500,
      "end_ms": 397455,
      "text": "不是脚下慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00161",
      "start_ms": 397810,
      "end_ms": 403490,
      "text": "是心里没有下一站在催您最后问问您这十处古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00162",
      "start_ms": 403490,
      "end_ms": 406655,
      "text": "您去过几处最想去的是哪一处？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00163",
      "start_ms": 407000,
      "end_ms": 407995,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00164",
      "start_ms": 408450,
      "end_ms": 410525,
      "text": "觉得这期让您长了见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00165",
      "start_ms": 410860,
      "end_ms": 412660,
      "text": "就转给身边跟您一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00166",
      "start_ms": 412680,
      "end_ms": 414125,
      "text": "爱看古镇风物的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00167",
      "start_ms": 414690,
      "end_ms": 415930,
      "text": "想听更多大美。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00168",
      "start_ms": 415930,
      "end_ms": 418150,
      "text": "中国山河的故事点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11293bda31d14a7_s00169",
      "start_ms": 418370,
      "end_ms": 419815,
